          <li><h3>Work keeps it current</h3><p>Every inspection and work order writes back to the asset profile. Nobody re-keys a field visit.</p></li>
          <li><h3>It holds up to an audit</h3><p>Who entered what, and what changed since. Audit-ready by default, not rebuilt when the auditor calls.</p></li>
        </ul>
